# Commit Trailer Format

- For every git commit created in this repository, include the trailer block exactly at the end of the commit message body:
  - `Author: Savin I. Razvan`
  - `GitHub-User: @SavinRazvan`
  - `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Author` is required for every commit.
- `Co-authored-by` is optional and should be added only when another real contributor co-authored the commit.
- `Author` must use the display name `Savin I. Razvan`.
- `GitHub-User` must use `@SavinRazvan`.
- Do not use alternative labels (`Made by`, `Made-by`, `Made with`) or one-line variants.
